#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:1
msgid "E4186"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `guard_not_supported_in_longest_match_strategy`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:5
msgid ""
"This diagnostic code was used for guards in longest-match lexical cases "
"and is not emitted by the current compiler. The current diagnostic is "
"[E4217](E4217.md)."
msgstr "此诊断码曾用于最长匹配词法分支中的守卫，当前编译器已不再发出该诊断。当前对应的诊断是 [E4217](E4217.md)。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:9
msgid ""
"The longest-match strategy decides which regex case wins before running "
"the case body. Case guards would make that decision depend on arbitrary "
"expressions, so they are rejected for `lexmatch ... with longest`."
msgstr ""
"最长匹配策略会在运行分支主体之前决定哪个正则分支胜出。分支守卫会让这个决定依赖任意表达式，因此在 `lexmatch ... with "
"longest` 中会被拒绝。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:13
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    \"abc\" if text.length() > 0 => ()\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:19
msgid "The first case has an `if` guard."
msgstr "第一个分支带有 `if` 守卫。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:21
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:23
msgid ""
"Move the condition into the case body so selection depends only on the "
"regex patterns."
msgstr "将条件移入分支主体，使分支选择只依赖正则模式。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4186.md:26
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    re\"^abc$\" => if text.length() > 0 { () }\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
